#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9723 expect=skipped domain=SE
#note "Neither ETCD nor SEUPDES is in the dataset: Requirements.Variables.All [ETCD] is unsatisfied, so the sister skips naming ETCD. ETCD is Required in SE, so this shape is already reported by the generic Required-variable rules; the sister has nothing to add without the trigger column."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset SE label="Subject Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SESEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
---
S1 | SE | 001 | 1 | Screening
